./docs/contracts/NUSANTARA-CONTROL-PLANE-V1.md:73:- GET `/v1/control-plane/models`: authenticated provider inventory; no generation or model installation.
./docs/contracts/NUSANTARA-CONTROL-PLANE-V1.md:74:- POST `/v1/control-plane/model-selection`: authenticated selection with `model` and `expected_revision`; returns APPLIED only after inventory validation and owner commit.
./docs/commands/NUSANTARA-MDE-ATTESTATION-BROWSER-E2E-001.md:74:4. Semua dokumen/aset/API harus di-fulfill dari memori. Allowlist tepat: GET dokumen `/overview`, `/evidence`, `/test`, `/review`, `/decision`; GET `/main.js`, `/main.css`; GET `/v1/control-plane/snapshot`; POST `/v1/control-plane/intention` dengan JSON persis scope/version sintetis. Query, metode/body/route/origin lain ditolak. Tidak boleh `continue`, real fetch, forwarding, redirect ke live service, atau proxy ke backend.
./docs/contracts/NUSANTARA-INTELLIGENCE-MODEL-CONTRACT-V1.md:16:Perubahan client recovery mempunyai backup `reports/v1-recovery-backup-20261006/app/api/routes.py`; rollback selektif memerlukan pemeriksaan perubahan pengguna dan regression, bukan penggantian otomatis seluruh file.
